  message: "Merged as PR #2766 (manual merge by human per governance workflow). The close subcommand is now available: ./scripts/merge-pr close <PR> [--reason text]. Empty tracker-sync PRs and superseded PRs can now be closed via the sanctioned CI script without asking the human to click the forge UI."  # 9054
